WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Now my wife is going to show off her washing machine.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
It was a gift. Oh.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
And my new Edesa works wonderfully.

4
